  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<para>For questions 1 – 8, simplify each expression completely. </para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="797d949c-c062-47f4-b4e6-85ada2754aee"><problem><para>
      <para>\((5h^2)(-3h^2)\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(-15h^2\)</para><para>\(-15h^4\)</para><para>\(-15h\)</para><para>\(-15h^8\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(-15h^4\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(-15h^4\). </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
